                    {
                        "sense_id": "3e67bc14-684b-3657-acf5-8e042120e102",
                        "entry_id": "165a79d8-c7f3-39d1-bee5-cd99c6b36bd9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eigenaar van een pand dat verhuurd wordt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "beroep"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e27d9e23-7546-4c2a-ba12-78b881baec64",
                                "sense_id": "3e67bc14-684b-3657-acf5-8e042120e102",
                                "text": "Er bestaat geen betere stad dan Venetië om in aan te komen terwijl er een geliefde op je wacht. Clio was mij vooruitgereisd. We hadden de taken verdeeld. Terwijl het mijn opdracht was geweest om onze oude huizen bezemschoon op te leveren en de laatste formaliteiten af te handelen met de respectievelijke huisbazen, was zij alvast naar Venetië gegaan om ons nieuwe huis aan kant te maken en de verhuizers te ontvangen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fe749491-c943-4148-a3e4-9c837df3bcdf",
                        "source_entry_id": "165a79d8-c7f3-39d1-bee5-cd99c6b36bd9",
                        "source_sense_id": "3e67bc14-684b-3657-acf5-8e042120e102",
                        "target_lang_word": "landlord",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "landlord",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84194766-5e83-3bef-a439-2c4c119939ea",
                                        "entry_id": "4befbc28-013a-33db-9600-4240eb6b53d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person that leases real property; a lessor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7530885a-636f-486d-933b-b895410316b5",
                                                "sense_id": "84194766-5e83-3bef-a439-2c4c119939ea",
                                                "text": "Brethren, brethren, it were better to haue this communitie,\nThen to haue this difference in degrees:\nThe landlord his rent, the lawyer his fees.\nSo quickly the poore mans ſubſtance is ſpent […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c2eecb5-29f7-3b32-8059-ebd997da64bb",
                                        "entry_id": "4befbc28-013a-33db-9600-4240eb6b53d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The owner or manager of a public house."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18ec27c3-fa85-4a70-b494-79ecec76c7e4",
                                                "sense_id": "9c2eecb5-29f7-3b32-8059-ebd997da64bb",
                                                "text": "When asked to explain why he became a landlord, he told the Archbishop of York it was so he could close the pub on Sundays, and suppress the profane language and singing that came through the bar windows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "358caf9f-e361-349b-b1f7-a556599d9cb2",
                                        "entry_id": "4befbc28-013a-33db-9600-4240eb6b53d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shark, imagined as the owner of the surf to be avoided."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "with-definite-article"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbddd8b3-8cf9-460d-a16a-43487d2101c9",
                                                "sense_id": "358caf9f-e361-349b-b1f7-a556599d9cb2",
                                                "text": "the lurking presence of “The Landlord”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ba90b7a-b928-4eb0-a339-be5b6a74fefe",
                        "source_entry_id": "165a79d8-c7f3-39d1-bee5-cd99c6b36bd9",
                        "source_sense_id": "3e67bc14-684b-3657-acf5-8e042120e102",
                        "target_lang_word": "landlady",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "landlady",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39b82ce0-a477-3afc-a68e-0e00a7b699cb",
                                        "entry_id": "198c3edf-ea49-3888-a0e0-0aa44b219ed9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female landlord."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42ea1de1-012c-4f96-84b0-b278cd749332",
                                                "sense_id": "39b82ce0-a477-3afc-a68e-0e00a7b699cb",
                                                "text": "In a large bedroom upstairs, the window of which was thickly curtained with a great woollen shawl lately discarded by the landlady, Mrs. Rolliver, were gathered on this evening nearly a dozen persons, all seeking vinous bliss; all old inhabitants of the nearer end of Marlott, and frequenters of this retreat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cadf51c9-203d-4dbb-b997-f7b3e1917458",
                                                "sense_id": "39b82ce0-a477-3afc-a68e-0e00a7b699cb",
                                                "text": "Yet Clacton, like every other station at a big seaside resort, is bedevilled by the traditional insistence of boarding-house landladies that their clients must arrive on Saturday before lunch and leave on Saturday after breakfast."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
